  The Ring Tempts You,cr_rule_701.54a,"Certain spells and abilities have the text \"the Ring tempts you.\" Each time the Ring tempts you, choose a creature you control. That creature becomes your Ring-bearer until another creature becomes your Ring-bearer or another player gains control of it.",0,rule_text_not_printed_reminder
  Face a Villainous Choice,cr_rule_701.55a,"\"[A player] faces a villainous choice - [option A], or [option B]\" means \"[A player] chooses [option A] or [option B]. Then all actions in the chosen option are performed.\"",0,rule_text_not_printed_reminder
